{"id":"0d3c57938187ab03","group":"14","path":"14/14-thm-topological-sheafification-by-germs.md","title":"Theorem II.5 Topological Sheafification by Germs","display":"Theorem II.5 Topological Sheafification by Germs","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-thm-topological-sheafification-by-germs","aliases":["14-thm-topological-sheafification-by-germs"],"display":"Theorem II.5 Topological Sheafification by Germs","depends_on":["[[14-thm-sheaf-recovery-from-germ-sections]]","[[14-thm-etale-bundle-recovery]]","[[14-df-stalk-maps]]","[[14-thm-sheaf-of-continuous-sections]]"],"source_location":"II.5 Theorem 2 and Corollary 4, printed 86–87; DjVu 49","source_evidence":"附件中的原稿来源记录；本次修订不构成对相应原书或 OCR 的读取证明。"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-thm-topological-sheafification-by-germs"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-thm-topological-sheafification-by-germs</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Theorem II.5 Topological Sheafification by Germs"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b95e7093b0f57f47\" href=\"?note=b95e7093b0f57f47\" title=\"14-thm-sheaf-recovery-from-germ-sections\">14-thm-sheaf-recovery-from-germ-sections</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"136d21829e234687\" href=\"?note=136d21829e234687\" title=\"14-thm-etale-bundle-recovery\">14-thm-etale-bundle-recovery</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"35aa7f1836ebd037\" href=\"?note=35aa7f1836ebd037\" title=\"14-df-stalk-maps\">14-df-stalk-maps</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"83765a3303e549f5\" href=\"?note=83765a3303e549f5\" title=\"14-thm-sheaf-of-continuous-sections\">14-thm-sheaf-of-continuous-sections</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_location","html":"II.5 Theorem 2 and Corollary 4, printed 86–87; DjVu 49"},{"key":"source_evidence","html":"附件中的原稿来源记录；本次修订不构成对相应原书或 OCR 的读取证明。"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>固定 Grothendieck 宇宙 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V\\)</span>；空间载体、截面值与指标集均取于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\">\\(\\mathcal U\\)</span>，有关范畴和函子集合在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal V\\)</span> 中处理。</p>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(X,\\tau)\">\\((X,\\tau)\\)</span> 为拓扑空间，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P:\\mathrm{OpenCat}(X,\\tau)\\to\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}\">\\(P:\\mathrm{OpenCat}(X,\\tau)\\to\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}\\)</span> 为预层，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(X,\\tau)\">\\((X,\\tau)\\)</span> 上的层，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Nat}_X(P,F)\">\\(\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Nat}_X(P,F)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a_XP=\\Gamma_X\\Lambda_XP\">\\(a_XP=\\Gamma_X\\Lambda_XP\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta_P\">\\(\\eta_P\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b95e7093b0f57f47\" href=\"?note=b95e7093b0f57f47\" title=\"14-thm-sheaf-recovery-from-germ-sections\">14-thm-sheaf-recovery-from-germ-sections</a>。对茎态射采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"35aa7f1836ebd037\" href=\"?note=35aa7f1836ebd037\" title=\"14-df-stalk-maps\">14-df-stalk-maps</a>。分量公式取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\\in\\tau\">\\(U\\in\\tau\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h\\in(a_XP)(U)\">\\(h\\in(a_XP)(U)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta_{F,U}^{-1}\">\\(\\eta_{F,U}^{-1}\\)</span> 是层恢复同构分量的底层逆函数。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Nat}\">\\(\\mathrm{Nat}\\)</span> 沿用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"83765a3303e549f5\" href=\"?note=83765a3303e549f5\" title=\"14-thm-sheaf-of-continuous-sections\">14-thm-sheaf-of-continuous-sections</a> 中的精确签名。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\overline\\theta_U(h)=\\eta_{F,U}^{-1}\\bigl((\\Lambda_X\\theta)\\circ h\\bigr),\\qquad\\overline\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Nat}_X(a_XP,F).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\overline\\theta_U(h)=\\eta_{F,U}^{-1}\\bigl((\\Lambda_X\\theta)\\circ h\\bigr),\\qquad\\overline\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Nat}_X(a_XP,F).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\overline\\theta\\circ\\eta_P=\\theta,\\qquad\\exists!\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Nat}_X(a_XP,F)\\;(\\alpha\\circ\\eta_P=\\theta).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\overline\\theta\\circ\\eta_P=\\theta,\\qquad\\exists!\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Nat}_X(a_XP,F)\\;(\\alpha\\circ\\eta_P=\\theta).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall x\\in X\\;(\\eta_P)_x:P_x\\xrightarrow{\\sim}(a_XP)_x.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall x\\in X\\;(\\eta_P)_x:P_x\\xrightarrow{\\sim}(a_XP)_x.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\overline\\theta:=\\operatorname{TNat}_X\\left(a_XP,F,((h\\mapsto\\eta_{F,U}^{-1}((\\Lambda_X\\theta)\\circ h)))_{U\\in\\tau}\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\overline\\theta:=\\operatorname{TNat}_X\\left(a_XP,F,((h\\mapsto\\eta_{F,U}^{-1}((\\Lambda_X\\theta)\\circ h)))_{U\\in\\tau}\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>存在性由把茎截面经 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Lambda\\theta\">\\(\\Lambda\\theta\\)</span> 送到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> 的茎截面，再用层的恢复同构得到。任意 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a_XP\">\\(a_XP\\)</span> 截面局部来自 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span>；两个因子若在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> 上相同，便在覆盖上相同，由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> 分离性全局相同，证明唯一性。茎上的单位满射由同一个局部来源性质得到；若两个原茎在层化后相同，则在邻域上其基本截面一致，特别在该点原茎相同，故单射。这给出具体构造而非只重复抽象泛性质。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-thm-sheaf-recovery-from-germ-sections","status":"resolved","id":"b95e7093b0f57f47","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-thm-sheaf-recovery-from-germ-sections]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-thm-etale-bundle-recovery","status":"resolved","id":"136d21829e234687","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-thm-etale-bundle-recovery]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-stalk-maps","status":"resolved","id":"35aa7f1836ebd037","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-stalk-maps]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-thm-sheaf-of-continuous-sections","status":"resolved","id":"83765a3303e549f5","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-thm-sheaf-of-continuous-sections]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-thm-sheaf-recovery-from-germ-sections","status":"resolved","id":"b95e7093b0f57f47","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $(X,\\tau)$ 为拓扑空间，$P:\\mathrm{OpenCat}(X,\\tau)\\to\\mathbf{Set}_{\\m